  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rollup | devDependencies | patch | `1.1.0` -> `1.1.2` | [source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rollup/rollup</summary>\n\n### [`v1.1.2`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;112)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.1.1...v1.1.2)\n\n_2019-01-21_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Tree-shaken dynamic imports no longer leave behind `undefined` entries in the bundle information ([#&#8203;2663](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2663))\n-   Dynamic imports in dynamically imported files could lead to crashes and would not always create new chunks ([#&#8203;2664](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2664))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2663](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2663): Do not include tree-shaken dynamic imports in bundle information ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2664](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2664): Properly handle dynamic imports declared in dynamically imported files ([@&#8203;everdimension](https://togithub.com/everdimension))\n\n### [`v1.1.1`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;111)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.1.0...v1.1.1)\n\n_2019-01-19_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Make sure object prototype methods are not considered to be falsy when tree-shaking ([#&#8203;2652](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2652))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2652](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2652): Make sure object prototype methods are not considered to be falsy ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2654](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2654): Use correct signature for `this.setAssetSource` in docs ([@&#8203;everdimension](https://togithub.com/everdimension))\n-   [#&#8203;2656](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2656): Swap descriptions for `[extname]` and `[ext]` in docs ([@&#8203;tivac](https://togithub.com/tivac))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
